      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Bestia putrificus. Bestia putrificus. Oh, you found my Book of Curses. How helpful of you.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704066,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "<italics>Why</italics> are you being so helpful?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704066,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Broken Branch sound as if they are using Scholomari curses on the Vampires? Wonderful! Which one?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704066,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "\"Mutatio Mortalis?\" Shame. I was hoping they were trying one that worked. Even the Gray Man himself can't cast that little hex.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704066,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It is probably for the best at any rate, right? We wouldn't want a spell like that flying around. It would destroy our entire civilization.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704066,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, keeping a Gargoyle locked in perpetual stone? That one is easy: \"Mutatio Saxum.\" Well, you also need a poultice of Gargoyle Dust dumped on its head.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704066,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-GRAVE-NPC15A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You can use this same method to trap a mortal into a stone state forever. That does sound fun, actually. Where can I find a mortal at this hour?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_WitchF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sister_Beastbane_DM-GRAVE_013.mp3",
